    "type": "html",
    "html": "<section class=\"sec bg-parch\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"head-row\"><div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">What we handle</p><h2 class=\"h2 big\">Every detail, <span class=\"it\">under one roof.</span></h2></div><p class=\"lead reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\">One producer owns your file from first sketch to final transfer.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14\"><div class=\"grid g-3\"><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"m15.5 8.5-2 5-5 2 2-5z\"/></svg></span><h3>A dedicated journey producer</h3><p>One person shapes your trip and stays with it.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M2.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0\"/><path d=\"M16 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7M21.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 0-4-6\"/></svg></span><h3>A private Guardian Guide</h3><p>Your own host and cultural interpreter, at your pace.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:160ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 21h18M5 21V10l7-6 7 6v11\"/><path d=\"M10 21v-5a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v5M8 12h.01M16 12h.01\"/></svg></span><h3>Hand-picked houses</h3><p>Palaces, riads and camps we know room by room.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/></svg></span><h3>Tables that are not listed</h3><p>From a family kitchen in Fès to a chef’s night in Marrakech.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:320ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4\"/></svg></span><h3>A night on the erg</h3><p>Dunes, stars and a private tent with a proper bath.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:400ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z\"/></svg></span><h3>24/7 concierge</h3><p>A single WhatsApp thread, at any hour.</p></article></div></div></div></section>"
   },
