    "type": "html",
    "html": "<section class=\"sec bg-ivory\"><div class=\"container cols c-8-4 items-start\"><div><div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Sample program</p><h2 class=\"h2 big\">A first week in Morocco, <span class=\"it\">for two.</span></h2></div><div class=\"mt-14\"><ol class=\"days\"><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">01<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Marrakech</h3><p>Riad check-in, a private medina walk and dinner on a rooftop.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/15260622/pexels-photo-15260622.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Marrakech palace interior\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">03<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Atlas and the road south</h3><p>Over the Tizi n'Tichka pass to Aït Benhaddou and the Dades Valley.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/37684084/pexels-photo-37684084.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1800\" alt=\"The earthen kasbah of Aït Benhaddou\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">05<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Sahara</h3><p>Camel trek at sunset and two nights in a luxury camp at Merzouga.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/10434667/pexels-photo-10434667.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1800\" alt=\"Private desert camp in the Sahara\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">07<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Fès</h3><p>A cooking session with a family, then your onward flight.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/22711555/pexels-photo-22711555.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Craft stalls in the Fès medina\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li></ol></div></div>\n<aside class=\"sticky reveal-right\"><div class=\"box\"><h3>Make it yours</h3><p>This program is a starting point. Every day can be adjusted to your dates, group and budget.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-gold \" data-inquiry=\"custom\"><span>Adapt this program</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div></aside></div></section><section class=\"sec-sm bg-parch\"><div class=\"container cols c-7-5 items-center\"><div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">For travel advisors</p><h2 class=\"h2 big\">We work <span class=\"it\">white-label.</span></h2><p class=\"lead\">Net rates, and documents in your brand on request. We never contact your clients directly.</p></div><p class=\"reveal\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/services/ground-handling\"><span>Ground handling for the trade</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p></div></section>"
