  "hero_subtitle": "Morocco gives your top performers what a standard reward trip cannot: a few hours from Europe or one overnight from the East Coast, a different world on arrival. We build programs that mix comfort, adventure and moments nobody else gets to have.",
  "hero_extra": "<div class=\"ctas\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-gold \" data-inquiry=\"incentive\"><span>Plan an incentive</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/case-studies\">See case studies</a></div><dl class=\"facts\"><div><span>Group size</span><b>20 to 400+</b></div><div><span>Typical length</span><b>3 to 5 nights</b></div><div><span>Popular base</span><b>Marrakech</b></div></dl>",
