    "html": "<section class=\"sec bg-parch\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"head-row\"><div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">What we handle</p><h2 class=\"h2 big\">Every detail, <span class=\"it\">under one roof.</span></h2></div><p class=\"lead reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\">One producer owns your file from first sketch to final transfer.</p></div><div class=\"mt-14\"><div class=\"grid g-3\"><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\"/><path d=\"M2.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0\"/><path d=\"M16 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7M21.5 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 0-4-6\"/></svg></span><h3>Airport meet & greet</h3><p>VIP fast track and a welcome team at arrivals.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 21h18M5 21V10l7-6 7 6v11\"/><path d=\"M10 21v-5a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v5M8 12h.01M16 12h.01\"/></svg></span><h3>Hotel & riad contracting</h3><p>Rooming lists, upgrades and full buyouts.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:160ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 16v-4l2-5h14l2 5v4H3z\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"16.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"16.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span><h3>Private coaches & 4x4 fleets</h3><p>Vetted drivers and vehicles for every transfer.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"m15.5 8.5-2 5-5 2 2-5z\"/></svg></span><h3>Licensed guides</h3><p>Small groups in the medina, one guide per group.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:320ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4\"/></svg></span><h3>Team activities</h3><p>Quad biking, balloon flights, treasure hunts in the souk.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:400ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9h18M5 9v11M19 9v11M8 9V5h8v4\"/></svg></span><h3>Themed dinners & venues</h3><p>Riad dinners, desert galas and private terraces.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:480ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"8\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 8v13M12 8S10 3 7.5 4.5 9 8 12 8zM12 8s2-5 4.5-3.5S15 8 12 8z\"/></svg></span><h3>Gifting & branding</h3><p>Welcome gifts, branded kits and artisan keepsakes.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:560ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 16V11a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v5l1.5 2h-15z\"/><path d=\"M10 20a2 2 0 0 0 4 0M12 3v2\"/></svg></span><h3>On-site hospitality desk</h3><p>A desk in your hotel, staffed throughout.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:640ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 4.5 3.4 8.3 8 9 4.6-.7 8-4.5 8-9V6z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><h3>Duty of care</h3><p>Insurance, emergency procedures and a 24/7 line.</p></article></div></div></div></section>"
