    "type": "html",
    "html": "<section class=\"sec bg-ivory\"><div class=\"container cols c-8-4 items-start\"><div><div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Sample program</p><h2 class=\"h2 big\">4 nights, Marrakech and Agafay, <span class=\"it\">80 guests.</span></h2></div><div class=\"mt-14\"><ol class=\"days\"><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">01<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Arrival and welcome dinner</h3><p>Meet and greet at the airport, check in, then a welcome dinner in a private riad.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/7391720/pexels-photo-7391720.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Riad lounge with carved plaster and lantern light\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">02<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Medina discovery</h3><p>The medina in small groups with licensed guides. Afternoon at leisure, then rooftop cocktails.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/15260622/pexels-photo-15260622.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Marrakech palace interior\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">03<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Adventure and a desert gala</h3><p>Quad biking or a hot-air balloon flight, then a gala dinner under the stars in Agafay.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"/assets/img/photos/agafay-desert-camp-1600.webp\" alt=\"Stony hills of the Agafay desert with white camp tents and the snow-capped Atlas behind\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">04<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Atlas Mountains</h3><p>A Berber village visit and lunch with a local family.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/29976840/pexels-photo-29976840.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Kasbah in the Atlas foothills\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li><li class=\"day reveal\"><span class=\"d\">05<small>Day</small></span><div><h3>Departures</h3><p>Farewell breakfast and private transfers to the airport.</p></div><div class=\"thumb\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/27945049/pexels-photo-27945049.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Palace courtyard with fountain and arches\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></li></ol></div></div>\n<aside class=\"sticky reveal-right\"><div class=\"box\"><h3>Make it yours</h3><p>This program is a starting point. Every day can be adjusted to your dates, group and budget.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-gold \" data-inquiry=\"incentive\"><span>Adapt this program</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></div></aside></div></section>"
