stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M5 11a7 7 0 0 0 14 0M12 18v3\"/></svg></span><h3>Audiovisual & production</h3><p>Stage, sound and light with trusted local crews.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:320ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 9h18M5 9v11M19 9v11M8 9V5h8v4\"/></svg></span><h3>Catering & themed dinners</h3><p>From coffee breaks to a gala for 400.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:400ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 4.5 3.4 8.3 8 9 4.6-.7 8-4.5 8-9V6z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><h3>Permits & local liaison</h3><p>Authority approvals, security and licences.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:480ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14 14 0 0 0 0 18\"/></svg></span><h3>Interpreters & hosts</h3><p>Multilingual staff for sessions and welcome.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:560ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4\"/></svg></span><h3>Pre- and post-event tours</h3><p>Extend the trip with a desert night or the Atlas.</p></article><article class=\"vcard lift reveal\" style=\"transition-delay:640ms\"><span class=\"ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"/></svg></span><h3>Run of show</h3><p>A minute-by-minute plan and an on-site lead.</p></article></div></div></div></section>"
