    "html": "<section class=\"sec bg-ink\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"head-row\"><div class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">What we produce</p><h2 class=\"h2 big\">Events, <span class=\"it\">edited.</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"grid g-3 mt-14\"><a class=\"dcard reveal\" href=\"/case-studies\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/27945049/pexels-photo-27945049.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Palace courtyard with fountain and arches\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"cap\"><span class=\"kicker\" style=\"color:var(--gold-light)\">Retreats</span><h3>Board & leadership retreats</h3><p class=\"more\">Quiet houses with room to think, and dinners with no speeches.</p></div></a><a class=\"dcard reveal\" href=\"/case-studies\"><img src=\"/assets/img/photos/agafay-desert-camp-1600.webp\" alt=\"Stony hills of the Agafay desert with white camp tents and the snow-capped Atlas behind\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"cap\"><span class=\"kicker\" style=\"color:var(--gold-light)\">Galas</span><h3>Gala dinners & award nights</h3><p class=\"more\">Desert, palace or rooftop — produced to the minute.</p></div></a><a class=\"dcard reveal\" href=\"/case-studies\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/7391720/pexels-photo-7391720.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Riad lounge with carved plaster and lantern light\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"cap\"><span class=\"kicker\" style=\"color:var(--gold-light)\">Celebrations</span><h3>Weddings & private celebrations</h3><p class=\"more\">Riads, gardens and long tables lit by lanterns.</p></div></a><a class=\"dcard reveal\" href=\"/case-studies\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/15260622/pexels-photo-15260622.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&dpr=2&w=1600\" alt=\"Marrakech palace interior\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"cap\"><span class=\"kicker\" style=\"color:var(--gold-light)\">Launches</span><h3>